cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WakeNudge in research or reference it, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "WakeNudge: Alarm Clock"
abstract: >-
  WakeNudge is a free, open-source alarm clock for Android with wake-up missions (math, memory, typing, QR code, NFC,
  shake, steps, squats, puzzles, photo), a still-awake check, an anti-oversleep toolkit with an emergency stop, and an
  Alarm Health checkup. It works offline, with no ads, accounts or tracking.
authors:
  - name: "riyadm (riyadmondol2006)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/riyadmondol2006/WakeNudge"
url: "https://wakenudge.site"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - android
  - alarm clock
  - wake-up missions
  - open source
  - offline
  - privacy
  - kotlin
  - jetpack compose
